//! injection, operator lowering) is hand-written reviewed Rust in `tool_schema.rs`. The generator
//! can only add typed, validated, non-code tools -- it never emits boundary logic.
//!
//! Counts: 509 operator tools, 14827 typed operator params emitted (post-fold), + 35 utility tools.

